				<pubDate>Tue, 05 Feb 2008 12:37:25 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://justaddwater.dk/2008/02/05/data-visualisation/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;What a treasury of old and new maps, images, graphs &amp;ndash; all you can imagine. &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.math.yorku.ca/SCS/Gallery/milestone/&#34;&gt;www.math.yorku.ca/SCS/Gallery/milestone/&lt;/a&gt; (found via wikipedia: &lt;a href=&#34;http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Information_graphics&#34;&gt;information graphics&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.math.yorku.ca/SCS/Gallery/milestone/&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://justaddwater.dk/wp-content/uploads/2008/02/visualization-milestones-0007_downsize.png&#34; alt=&#34;visualization-milestones-0007_downsize.png&#34; width=&#34;448&#34; height=&#34;236&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Actually, I&amp;rsquo;m in the middle of preparing a workshop where some of these visualizations can serve as background inspiration material.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Update later same day: Add to this the &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.visual-literacy.org/periodic_table/periodic_table.html&#34;&gt;Periodic Table of Visualization Methods&lt;/a&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.visual-literacy.org/periodic_table/periodic_table.html&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://justaddwater.dk/wp-content/uploads/2008/02/periodic-table-of-visualization_resize.png&#34; alt=&#34;periodic-table-of-visualization_resize.png&#34; width=&#34;448&#34; height=&#34;394&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Just including a few here for inspiration:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://justaddwater.dk/wp-content/uploads/2008/02/example-0044-coxcombchart.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;example-0044-coxcombchart.jpg&#34; width=&#34;378&#34; height=&#34;434&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://justaddwater.dk/wp-content/uploads/2008/02/example-0092-main_sequence.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;example-0092-main_sequence.jpg&#34; width=&#34;283&#34; height=&#34;335&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://justaddwater.dk/wp-content/uploads/2008/02/example-0076-roussew-bivariate-plot-bagplot.gif&#34; alt=&#34;example-0076-roussew-bivariate-plot-bagplot.gif&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://justaddwater.dk/wp-content/uploads/2008/02/example-0072-phillipscurve.gif&#34; alt=&#34;example-0072-phillipscurve.gif&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://justaddwater.dk/wp-content/uploads/2008/02/example-0041-1870census-pryamidsjpg.gif&#34; alt=&#34;example-0041-1870census-pryamidsjpg.gif&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://justaddwater.dk/wp-content/uploads/2008/02/example-0057-roesle-image008.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;example-0057-roesle-image008.jpg&#34; width=&#34;374&#34; height=&#34;387&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
